    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University has won an international award for the master plan of its new Faculty of Arts and Sciences campus to be built in Education City, 30 kms outside Karachi. The Society for College and University Planning and the American Institute of Architecture presented the Honour Award for Excellence in Planning for a New Campus to AKU and its architects Payette Associates at their annual conference in Montreal, Canada last week.",
